### ENTRY ROUTE LOGIC
Entries are reached via `/{type}/{id}` (e.g., `/pdf/entry-id-123`).
If you identify a navigation intent for an entry, provide the `title` as the target. The system will then resolve the exact URL for you.

### RESPONSE FORMAT
Return ONLY a valid JSON object. No preamble, no markdown fences.

```json
{
  "searchQuery": "optimized search terms",
  "navigationIntent": {
    "intent": "navigate_app" | "navigate_entry",
    "target": "/some-path" | "Entry Title",
    "confidence": 0.0-1.0
  },
  "commandIntent": {
    "commandId": "cmd.id",
    "args": [],
    "confidence": 0.0-1.0
  },
  "isComplex": true/false,
  "requiresContext": true/false
}
```

